# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Cached market data. Regenerable from the exchange APIs via deltabt.data,
# and far too large for version control (~550 MB).
#
# ANCHORED TO THE REPOSITORY ROOT with a leading slash. Written as a bare
# `data/` it also matched `deltabt/data/` -- the SOURCE PACKAGE holding the
# REST client, the Parquet store and the universe screen -- and silently kept
# 737 lines of it out of the repository entirely. Nobody noticed until CI ran
# from a clean checkout and could not import `deltabt.data`, which took the
# GET-only client safety check down with it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/data/
# another session's working directory in this workspace; not part of this project
scratch_ist/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Research outputs. The experiment REGISTRY and the summary tables are the
# durable record and ARE tracked (see the negative rules below). Per-trade
# dumps and rendered figures are regenerable and are not.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
out/**/trades_*.csv
out/*.png
out/**/*.png
out/*.html

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Credentials. Nothing in this repo has ever used authenticated endpoints,
# and V1 paper trading must not either -- these rules exist so that stays true.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
credentials*
secrets*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv/
venv/
build/
dist/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local / editor
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
*.log
*.parquet
*.db
*.sqlite3

# Terraform: state and any real variable values must never be committed.
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform/
terraform.tfvars
*.auto.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
tfplan
tfplan.json
bootstrap.tfplan
bootstrap.tfplan.json

# Core dumps. One appeared on 2026-08-31 from an ad-hoc `python -c` reading
# parquet -- 1.3 GB of address space, 68 MB on disk -- and sat in `git status`
# for hours looking like something that needed a decision. A crash dump from a
# throwaway process is not a change to review.
core
core.*

# Derived from the operator's own Delta account statements in /data/, which is
# ignored above. THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC: these two files carry 275 real
# trades with entry, exit, quantity, notional and P&L. The findings drawn from
# them belong in commit messages and docs; the per-trade record does not belong
# on a public remote.
out/manual/
